<?php
return ['name' => 'attuned_ren_water_the_connector', 'displayTitle' => ['en' => 'Attuned Ren Water – The Connector', 'zh' => '身弱壬水'], 'locales' => ['en' => ['sections' => ['overview' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<p>Ren Water corresponds to great rivers. When attuned (with softer energy), Attuned Ren Water\'s currents are gentle rather than rushing. It naturally flows around obstacles and builds bridges between people with keen empathy and an ability to connect those around it. It thrives by embracing the wisdom that water benefits all things without competing. It doesn\'t need to stir up storms to make an impact. Instead, it becomes an undercurrent quietly nourishing its chosen field. Though subtle and formless on the surface, at critical moments it can catalyze change and prove indispensable.</p><p>Adaptable and Fluid: You have an innate wisdom of flow, handling matters flexibly and navigating complex situations with ease.<br/>Keenly Perceptive: Highly intuitive and quick to sense changes in your environment — just be careful not to let outside influences trigger self-doubt.<br/>Quietly Independent: You might seem to go with the flow, but you hold firm opinions of your own. When it counts, you show the water-like wisdom and resilience to support others without overt conflict.</p>'], 'love' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<p>Metal and Water. As an Attuned Ren Water type, you flow like a gentle stream and can sometimes feel a lack of direction or decisiveness. By tapping into the power of Metal and Water elements, you reinforce your inner stability, boost your courage and inspiration, and move forward with steadier, more effective action.</p>'], 'career' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<h4>Wealth</h4><p>Deepening your expertise in one field can lead to quiet but substantial profits. Leverage resources from mentors, leaders, or peers to get ahead, but avoid tying up too much capital in fixed assets or jumping on speculative bandwagons.</p><h4>Health</h4><p>Be mindful of seasonal allergies and minimize exposure to triggers. Support your kidneys by staying well-hydrated and limiting excess salt in your diet.</p><h4>Emotional Wellbeing</h4><p>You tend to overthink and drain your mental energy. Make time to reset through calming activities like swimming or practicing a soothing tea ritual. These activities help you replenish your vitality and maintain inner calm.</p><h4>Career Pathways</h4><p>Where You Flourish: Finance & Consulting: Banking, accounting, financial analysis, advisory roles. Transportation & Logistics: Airline services, logistics planning, supply chain coordination, shipping. Media & Communications: Journalism, editing, broadcasting, translation, content creation, public relations. Education & Social Services: Teaching, training, tour guiding, therapy or counseling. Where Energy Feels Drained: Construction & Real Estate: Civil engineering, property development, mining, geological exploration. Legal & Law Enforcement: Judge, prosecutor, police, military roles. Wholesale & Retail: Building materials trade, furniture sales.</p>'], 'relationship_friends' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>Jia Wood friends provide structure and purpose to your flowing nature. They help channel your adaptability into concrete plans and keep you focused on growing toward meaningful goals.</li><li>Wu Earth friends offer stability and grounding. They help you build solid foundations for your connections and provide emotional stability when you feel overwhelmed by feelings.</li></ul>'], 'relationship_couple' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>Jia Wood partners help organize your life while respecting your freedom. They provide gentle structure that allows your flowing nature to thrive within supportive boundaries.</li><li>Wu Earth partners offer rock-solid emotional support and practical stability. They ground your emotional depth while appreciating your intuitive wisdom.</li></ul>'], 'celebrities_international' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>Ryuichi Sakamoto: Japanese musician and anti-nuclear activist</li><li>Bill Gates: Microsoft co-founder turned philanthropist (supporting vaccine development, poverty alleviation, and education reform)</li><li>Neil Armstrong: The first astronaut to walk on the Moon</li></ul>'], 'celebrities_domestic' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>Liu Xiang: Olympic champion hurdler</li><li>Bai Yansong: Renowned TV host known for advocating social equality and funding journalism education in underprivileged areas</li><li>Yang Zhenning: Nobel Prize–winning physicist who fostered U.S.–China scientific exchange and championed basic research</li></ul>'], 'luckSuggestion_dailyTips' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>Wear metal jewelry or accessories to enhance your Metal energy</li><li>Take relaxing warm baths or soak in hot springs regularly to rejuvenate</li></ul>'], 'luckSuggestion_color' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>White (Metal): Symbolizes clarity and decisiveness. Incorporating white – for example, through white clothing or décor – can sharpen your focus and confidence, helping gentle Ren Water act boldly when needed.</li><li>Blue (Water): Represents calm and reason. Adding blue elements brings peace and stability, keeping you cool-headed and focused. A touch of blue in your surroundings clears your mind and inspires insightful thinking.</li></ul>'], 'luckSuggestion_location' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>West (Metal): Associated with authority and determination. Facing west bolsters your confidence and influence, giving your actions greater weight.</li><li>North (Water): Associated with inspiration and wisdom. Facing north can spark your creativity and foresight, helping you be more visionary in your decisions.</li></ul>']]], 'zh' => ['sections' => ['overview' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<p>壬水为江河之水，身弱则水势不湍急，善于流动与连接，具备共情力和联结周围的能力。身弱壬水的修炼在于领悟\'水利万物而不争\'的生存智慧，不必掀起惊涛骇浪，而是化身为润泽特定领域的暗流。它看似无形，却能在关键时刻推动变革，成为不可或缺的存在。</p><p>灵活通达：自带流动智慧，处事灵活，善于应对复杂局面。<br/>敏锐感知：内在感知力强，能快速捕捉环境变化，但需避免因外界影响而自我怀疑。<br/>有主见：表面随波逐流，实则有主见，关键时刻能展现\'水利万物而不争\'的智慧与韧性。</p>'], 'love' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<p>身弱壬水，喜用神为金、水。壬水如涓涓细流，身弱时力量不足，容易缺乏方向感与决断力。若能借助金水之力，就能增强内在稳定性，同时提升果敢与灵感，让行动更稳健且高效。</p>'], 'career' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<h4>财富运势</h4><p>深耕一个领域能闷声发财。宜借助长辈、领导或同龄伙伴的资源获利，避免固定资产重投入。</p><h4>健康隐患</h4><p>预防季节性过敏，减少接触过敏原；保护肾脏健康，保持充足水分摄入。</p><h4>情绪管理</h4><p>容易思虑过重消耗能量，可以通过游泳、茶道等活动重建能量。</p><h4>职业管理</h4><p>推荐行业：金融咨询业：银行业、会计、金融分析师、咨询顾问。交通与物流业：航空服务、物流规划、供应链协调、船运公司。媒体与传播业：记者、编辑、播音员、翻译、内容创作、公共关系。教育与社会服务业：教师、培训师、导游、心理咨询师。慎重行业：建筑与地产业：土木工程、房地产开发、矿山开采、地质勘探。法律执法业：法官、检察官、警察、军事人员。批发与零售业：建材贸易、家具行业。</p>'], 'relationship_friends' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>庚金：庚金如矿石般沉稳，能为你提供决策支撑，破除思维困局。</li><li>癸水：癸水和你同理心共振，能够形成同盟，共同抵抗困难。</li></ul>'], 'relationship_couple' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>乙木：乙木作为伴侣可以将你的流动善变的思维转化为具体的成果。</li><li>辛金：辛金能够提升你的认知维度。相处中，辛金擅长数据化分析，你擅长捕捉趋势。</li></ul>'], 'celebrities_international' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>坂本龙一（Ryuichi Sakamoto）：音乐家和反核活动家</li><li>Bill Gates：微软联合创始人，支持疫苗研发、消除贫困与教育改革</li><li>Neil Armstrong：首位登月宇航员</li></ul>'], 'celebrities_domestic' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>刘翔：奥运田径冠军</li><li>白岩松：知名主持人，长期关注社会公平议题，资助贫困地区新闻人才培养</li><li>鲁迅：新文化运动领袖</li><li>老舍：作家，推动现代白话文发展</li><li>蔡元培：教育家，北大校长，奠定中国现代高等教育体系</li><li>杨振宁：诺贝尔物理学奖得主，促进中美科学交流与基础学科建设</li></ul>'], 'luckSuggestion_dailyTips' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>佩戴金属饰品</li><li>泡温泉</li></ul>'], 'luckSuggestion_color' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>白色（金）：白色象征清晰与果敢，能增强决断力，让壬水在关键时刻更果敢。日常多用白色小物件，让行动更有方向感。</li><li>蓝色（水）：蓝色象征平静与理性，能稳定心神，让壬水在面对挑战时保持冷静与专注。适度加入蓝色元素，让思路更清晰。</li></ul>'], 'luckSuggestion_location' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>西方（金）：西方的能量象征权威与果敢，能帮助壬水增强影响力与掌控力，让行动更有分量。</li><li>北方（水）：北方的能量象征灵感与智慧，能激发创意，让壬水在行动与决策中更具前瞻性。</li></ul>']]]], 'version' => 1];
